    "body": "These setters follow the \"Set f.name to entry's name\" pattern as opposed to the \"Set f's name to entry's name\" pattern to match https://w3c.github.io/FileAPI/#dfn-file\r\n\r\nThat being said, lines 299 and 300 make a lot more sense in the current pattern (there's no ByteSequence definition to link to, AFAIK).... so maybe we should make this consistent and use the latter pattern for 301 through 303?",
